{"root":{"data":{"id":"dj4q8epnam80","created":1781029407933,"text":"珠你好运"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dj4q8u1uo6o0","created":1781029441323,"text":"产品定位"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dj4q9i4hdrs0","created":1781029493725,"text":"珠你好运 是一款融合 AI、传统文化、个性化设计与珠宝电商的新一代智能手串定制平台。\n用户可以通过 AI 一键生成专属手串，也可以像搭积木一样自由DIY设计，将水晶、玉石、木质珠、配件等。\n平台通过 AI 推荐系统、能量标签系统、文化寓意系统和智能设计引擎，让每个人都能拥有属于自己的「好运手串」。","layout_right_offset":{"x":152,"y":0}},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qbm9m5iw0","created":1781029659471,"text":"核心产品功能"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dj4qbpvyflc0","created":1781029667352,"text":"AI一键成串"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dj4qbzikapc0","created":1781029688310,"text":"用户输入：想要招财、事业运提升、暖色系、适合女生日常佩戴"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qc7mspyo0","created":1781029705980,"text":"AI自动完成"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dj4qcdtnn600","created":1781029719456,"text":"用户意图理解"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qcgk2mow0","created":1781029725407,"text":"风格分析"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qcjbfbao0","created":1781029731414,"text":"五行分析"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qcm28b7c0","created":1781029737389,"text":"水晶功效匹配"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qcs95npk0","created":1781029750868,"text":"SKU筛选"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qcv9sfds0","created":1781029757437,"text":"模板匹配"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qcxx25rc0","created":1781029763197,"text":"手围适配"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qd0ko6600","created":1781029768978,"text":"自动排版"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qda288u00","created":1781029789631,"text":"输出"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dj4qdd6ne3k0","created":1781029796429,"text":"设计图"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qddzelcg0","created":1781029798168,"text":"材料清单及价格"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qdlar3p40","created":1781029814091,"text":"寓意说明"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qdv1v7mg0","created":1781029835322,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-green","version":"1.4.43"}